    },
    {
      "id": "bipa6.u01.l13",
      "sha256": "af9506d58787edbe53ffb829332173b0ab4fbbe243aac67671a6d624a9eaa3b7"
    }
  ],
  "audio": [
    {
      "key": "03c63dcaa7a8aeb53dc03edf5cb2063ed3ea6e5d0f43e4fb250150985d13d268",
      "text": "berbisik",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 8,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "04a8a5b3ec25fd704f9f0a1145af63233aa2d3b784df467a16c2be854aee99fa",
      "text": "Di tengah keheningan, dia teringat suara riang anaknya, penuh kerinduan.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 72,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "05f90a4cbaf13b93753ead24173d4b68e5e2ef40a4f0d8203146fe25c1a8deac",
      "text": "cerpenis",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 8,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "07cc3d585f8870c642ce7de58c8944d20c8c71b354bfc4dcc217caedb1200e0c",
      "text": "tangisan",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 8,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "08b2672494ea90ae3cad31344c4a8d975d13d77fe739605d51bcc17dd0b54d58",
      "text": "Tafsiranmu menarik, Bang. Tapi buatku, hujan itu membersihkan, kayak awal yang baru.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 84,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "08d0029597b632b73b5416bf8d8bb7eec1a1f6b6afe6968092fd4babb7e8360c",
      "text": "Lumayan aja? Wah, nenekku pasti sedih kalau dengar.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 51,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "09200886e09386c036760ba5beea78e4468fcfc0d5e9951aa4dd9dcd9bded526",
      "text": "Cerpen ini punya akhir terbuka, jadi setiap pembaca menafsirkannya sendiri sesuai dengan pengalamannya.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 103,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "0973c2c826c73a38a9550ef0d1d2e3a398cd479b6816c09705a6c30f9dec95b1",
      "text": "\"Pergi!\" bentak lelaki tua itu, lalu dia menutup pintu karena tidak mau mendengar alasan anaknya.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 107,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "0ec7a0ae6efde875df831030682bf5f249e1090cc468c3c7cadd1d2eee97bc7b",
      "text": "Hebat! Redakturnya suka cerpen tentang kursi kosong itu?",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 56,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "0f669a12688452eb44f3cc31c64939e0fad93cbfc439d5d9399452c25e5406fd",
      "text": "Redaktur suka kalimat pembuka yang pendek dan kuat, supaya pembaca mau membaca sampai akhir.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 92,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "0fc28fa39f6809def9fefd1ced60a42cb673b6fbb08ab0d94dec4e4ba5abc31f",
      "text": "Gaya bahasanya sederhana, tetapi akhirnya sangat menyentuh.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 59,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "11cf04b5ab1e76e4c2e5a12a05d569082c46f5fdead0386c051e5708f65cc2f3",
      "text": "Setiap pembaca bisa menafsirkan cerpen itu secara berbeda, karena pengalaman hidup mereka juga berbeda.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 103,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "1230e9be9ef3f838c9ea3472fc165172b0826f5329d2800e908348f284df91fc",
      "text": "Mohamed, koran kampus lagi nyari cerita mini. Paling banyak seratus kata.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 73,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "131cda1b27980b45592d12f2718f375a6132e589b46fca5ef009d8f82c7a554f",
      "text": "Sejak kepergian anaknya, rumah itu terasa hampa.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 48,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "145be80b603e3f4b087c164baff1ab98c5838f79c9caffed28711c321f8355e4",
      "text": "menoleh",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 7,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "168c3bc7e53ecb82dedff5f38e7864754b62db014242a5e2bfabc30b922cbff2",
      "text": "Setuju. Amanatnya tetap sama: keluarga selalu nunggu.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 53,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "16b0ec82cee27374d069dc7f0da6cb80c8700ece2219c04af153beebdc5c51d3",
      "text": "Iya. Pilih satu pencerita, tambahin sedikit dialog, terus berhenti.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 67,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "173b5be1962fb19a663f4ad75678e5e9b13f73e0a7c5a813a091e0aaed27a370",
      "text": "Ada yang memanggil namanya, tetapi dia tidak menoleh. Badannya merinding, dan kakinya tidak bisa bergerak. Rumah tua itu sunyi sekali.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 134,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "173dd32695a2b0ba072f863c4fbdf62a4182bb61cb53b89882b3362a718d1ebe",
      "text": "redaktur",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 8,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "19134101afbecb7442ba676dbfa7a1ea4df61462e3ff7e9ed1ee42772b832fce",
      "text": "terserah",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 8,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "1963874752a1671de6d2f34618d0f3da83ae27defb2ba635d8e38a222cbd43f0",
      "text": "tersurat",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 8,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "1a48f9990eff1e77194506b40225c0f5742f222d994f122f5e672e1d5dc64641",
      "text": "Cerpen ini pendek banget, tapi aku hampir nangis.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 49,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "1a9d94b8ced8cc26c41b4da286e0be67e375e7572e4b9cddd4c8729c607fb1cb",
      "text": "pagar",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 5,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "1c4cda2725e603829cc67306e7e4f81daa7fd61a7bd0cda56668eec94c77ae2f",
      "text": "Penulis tidak menulis kata sedih di cerita itu, tetapi isyaratnya jelas sekali bagi pembaca.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 92,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "1d3fd27f2d232d826e06a125444c5ae04d7895bc88e0b3da6e543df448c735dd",
      "text": "Tapi ternyata dapurnya kosong. Itu bukan hantu, itu kekosongan setelah istrinya meninggal.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 90,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "1f89e9557dd3afd26821924357733b893360e22a417d1762c5f777f9e26723ae",
      "text": "Anak itu merantau karena ada konflik dengan ayahnya. Sepuluh tahun kemudian, dia pulang tanpa memberi kabar. Ayahnya tidak berdiri, tetapi menuang teh ke dua cangkir.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 166,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "20fd14724cdbccbe68f5f2b5a5ec951c6152d80ba36b8b57b814f453411ec8da",
      "text": "Ibu hanya diam, lalu kembali mengaduk teh yang sudah lama dingin. Matanya melihat ke jendela. Dia tidak menjawab pertanyaan anaknya.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 132,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "2244bac9a071e6a4b2d03028055db7cdec403ffda588c304ccae909dbe22d9a4",
      "text": "Kalimat \"akhirnya terlalu cepat\"? Itu kritik yang sopan. Nggak apa-apa.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 81,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "2507576cd9b368c29465a86c36834224b730ec517ad51d29280da03df46f22da",
      "text": "pengarang",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 9,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "250f518c809aeab558d763dcc7bcc3cd06a0edbdfc78f6dbf9ff2835cf51865d",
      "text": "Dalam monolog batinnya, Pak Lubis bertanya apakah anaknya akan pulang, walaupun dia tahu jawabannya.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 100,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "2609f60069082456895c912a9c7a323c8390d9fe944a45842ab3d9b437fff482",
      "text": "bisikan",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 7,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "28d6e743f29315c6751f4c848a46f09972281b49ba5c861e68c7ba92aca176c7",
      "text": "Tidak ada suara sama sekali. Hanya ada ___.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 43,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "2994804ad3d62173579b7f53e48e471a50f34e9844f56d1bbf334fda8bb7fd32",
      "text": "mengesankan",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 11,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "2aa6de1c57c5da8662c16ef845572263a4a6ad3c79351bf3c5556c2343f9b6f3",
      "text": "Hujan dalam cerpen itu adalah simbol kesedihan, menurut saya.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 61,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "2c15d9fe7c1f6243fc949abd246c1c3762635ac1fe307402ce2e97f4e8dedf16",
      "text": "begadang",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 8,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "2c30daac80f65c684e3e3f5b35284b4e1a1c439587382d8c7283cfa078f35171",
      "text": "Ibunya nggak pernah bilang kalau dia sedih. Tangannya aja yang gemetar.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 71,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "2c91dd3627c1088e759362db985042c89191db9342988d02713c0e6f3ee7ab7b",
      "text": "Amanat cerpen ini adalah bahwa keluarga selalu menunggu kita pulang. Walaupun kita marah atau pergi jauh, pintu rumah tetap terbuka. Kursi kosong di teras adalah simbolnya.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 172,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "2e1c805b02bfcae81128eac918fdcc3f919e3aa550272f1573dabd898fb12f7a",
      "text": "nafkah",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 6,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "327ea9655694df23b395bfa292ea12a7c97e2f32d71ad08a425efdb0ff33d721",
      "text": "kerinduan",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 9,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "3382c6e1796e18987786fc62e1804dc449b0f24c59d7b5606faae18f06632fb4",
      "text": "Seno Gumira Ajidarma adalah cerpenis yang terkenal.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 51,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "3399799e208cf52a45e81d5fc27644c3300adc083d1c3118ffd67a6b87064be4",
      "text": "terpaku",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 7,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "345978f2170fa228058d9f1806e80133b798f1c57f45c7333e74e192d7908798",
      "text": "Nenek bergumam pelan sambil menjahit baju.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 42,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "3516b0810c623bcdfc6bdf2622d8c7a565fe6b224200aaec81f24b0cc441234d",
      "text": "kelam",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 5,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "3566f75c14232322b3b0057d6d612ca7cd44c4ddf3ddc51dc18884670349cac0",
      "text": "Betul. Terus di tengah cerita ada kilas balik ke Danau Toba.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 60,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "3581471a618f50b7876a7395231913f1971385cb628119a76f8109e99bfe257c",
      "text": "Barangkali dulu ada konflik. Dia takut ayahnya masih marah.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 59,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "382a044562980550a5facddff73c70d9fba1656d1760e7f61e06602bc642191b",
      "text": "bergumam",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 8,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "391b3c2cac6292c22259367aa42488c3eae22c2e475ebb5d1c813d2037c7426d",
      "text": "Dan tiap malam dia menghela napas di depan jendela.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 51,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "39ec0cc0bed822f0e771e77c61a8af2cb19fa88d46a01488c169bc3065d02e0e",
      "text": "gemetar",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 7,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "3ae9b2c53ca807e4e7a0d7bbbe37970093350de0308b7b49ec2bb260d145a3a5",
      "text": "Dia tidak marah secara tersurat, tetapi dia menyindir.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 54,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "3b0dc92c3c5c21c5e7b9df6f3a1227a08df42db3245eeb6c3bd0a44f247f9c3f",
      "text": "Anak yang lugu itu menyambut ayahnya dengan riang.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 50,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "3b6125acd5e2484ef1bf9e0e9f04ffb4b64b0f8dd7d335a5ac6411d30452e063",
      "text": "rindu",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 5,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "3bc45ed4734f49809406f65584ff1cfd1fc499a0d4bf2b814c58d0ec14cb517d",
      "text": "membentak",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 9,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "3e459ca0a0c7fcbcec38f015db544d4cf8567d39daa39f0840d704c11362f3d6",
      "text": "Rumah besar itu sepi; hidupnya terasa ___.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 42,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "43360b9f8241d18461fe6fcfe874a4370e1a651b909a6cc79b6c5e0f04c7528c",
      "text": "tanda petik",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 11,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "4600ec740a6cde82be095be17ec5108c51b811f78de92e26f1972a4346f24e42",
      "text": "Dari kamar sebelah terdengar tangisan seorang ibu. Anaknya berangkat merantau ke Malaysia pagi itu. Di meja, ada surat yang belum dibuka.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 137,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "46c6669719fa4446cb030e60cc374bd4036d61cf906cb7037ae5aeca98a71773",
      "text": "Anak yang lugu itu menyambutnya dengan riang.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 45,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "47266b9c8b9cf9d90ab216caa27107a6c2c3bf92f9bc2325f256626e4eb61f11",
      "text": "Semoga suatu hari cerpennya masuk kumpulan cerpen terbaik.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 58,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "47a28e4b485eab207a5bcd9b258b94c4fc8958334e27170c002efbf39769e636",
      "text": "keheningan",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 10,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "47e4de0cb6587303957b544f808c56b8c472c7565eeae970968bbb389eac77af",
      "text": "Mohamed, cerpen Bang Togar mau diterbitkan hari Minggu ini!",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 59,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "4af08bb433ee763bc31b5085e343e665062e4b8e0fb08513664aefb9a45020ee",
      "text": "cangkir",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 7,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "4c82f8c7a47329ce3240374bd5e021dd68e934b4741d38fcd08a04983866e05d",
      "text": "menghela",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 8,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "4d33757ac7c0a4fa9269313f81233aa301299a2a5fd897c8ecfb1e4397679b02",
      "text": "Dua cangkir! Jadi dia udah memaafkan anaknya. Itu makna tersiratnya.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 68,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "4da35025aaca5c6c0bdde9832f1123db6556f769ca93c3464a65afc843738544",
      "text": "haru",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 4,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "4ea6fc7601378cc93b957dfea08c80cfbca7ce0055fe1668a030ebcbd079212e",
      "text": "Keheningan malam pecah oleh sebuah bisikan.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 43,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "4ea81e4ce5a9903a0c1dfc340dc7f6c1b687574934142903e06c294c4d03617a",
      "text": "Terus ada bisikan dari dapur. Tokohnya menoleh...",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 49,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "504fbeadcc4ffe38c8d0b186cc826e71ef866fd3fb7ba1e2c839c8e4b3602d10",
      "text": "Cerpen ini diceritakan dari sudut pandang orang pertama, tentang masa kecilnya.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 79,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "52541459d120f8e31acedffd6835341314c15d40e1ea131690e705a011355d58",
      "text": "orang ketiga",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 12,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "527672ed07c66e00338c0adb0355ad3544c220dd2507761d25ca4933fe4494d5",
      "text": "Jadi, Mohamed, apa tema cerpen \"Kursi di Teras\"?",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 58,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "52e18039d9d0c6505445809950eb5a39b81971080b5d9bba93b6dfe6be66913d",
      "text": "Alur cerpen itu sederhana, tetapi temanya sangat kuat sehingga pembaca terus memikirkannya.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 91,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "53614cb6d8bc70e1d6d291d895269fa900b32f12967c84074fb6610be40675d6",
      "text": "Gayanya campuran, ya. Ada Tionghoa, Melayu, dan Eropa.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 54,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "55062b0f3a588c130a5f0919d414bacf1ef4bbf7efd6464d0d414936252b58ad",
      "text": "Tangannya gemetar, lalu dia menghela napas.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 43,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "57b816ab58ef08abec73176f36b24127902cab9b0a58daa75dc4a2ed428d4bd0",
      "text": "Cerita mini ini hanya seratus kata, tetapi ada kilas balik dan akhir terbuka. Tokohnya hanya dua orang. Pembaca harus menebak sendiri apa yang terjadi kemudian.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 160,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "5a83d41279c5b80f0efbc6cbf6141328b6f2cf5969a913660d468d3f27613270",
      "text": "Menurutku, rindu. Penulisnya nggak nulis kata \"rindu\", tapi kursi kosong itu isyaratnya.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 98,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "5aa400c9b647cf0dd2cf39807be444475ab5da16f43ace7e02945b4a8dee204c",
      "text": "Betul. Tapi dia bertahan demi nafkah keluarga.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 46,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "5bc3fe6ca8f1dbe5490cd8829e0e4fa7931b231c5931e0dff1a7eccb7a4a47fa",
      "text": "orang pertama",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 13,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "5cd4731f6bb01e188ee305d49e4ab136f65db0c6c7ad56936670045fb607d966",
      "text": "cerpen",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 6,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "5d12c06e0f7e09cfd2128ca06d20c3dbb4260a9ca473c937844d271469d42977",
      "text": "Ayahnya tersadar bahwa anaknya tidak lagi riang, karena dia terlalu lama bekerja di luar kota.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 94,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "5eba97dc1042a359a3c3ffb5775f09c36d174150fa5411745f5cfd6d6ec7fab6",
      "text": "Mohamed, aku udah baca ulasanmu tentang \"Kursi di Teras\". Bagus banget!",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 81,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "639e1c7f9ab3608395bac4b05efef46e2e9e63668875dcacd849ed7c8c74c228",
      "text": "Lumayan, Kak.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 13,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "64c41cc413a68eb02e614c0a3b3d0b09a28e2c46d42a53126c95a24e7cbea97c",
      "text": "Itulah orang Batak: kepergian udah biasa, tapi tetap berat.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 59,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "64c9f2f8352bc9a97d4eeee5a491ccf181fbbbadb8ee07b43c580a04271f6f2e",
      "text": "tersirat",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 8,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "67374e6e2386b2619778323ecc92b960a032cb8475d6259746037f85c41f0305",
      "text": "Banyak orang Batak merantau, tetapi mereka tidak lupa kampungnya.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 65,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "67cd51e433ce44c48682835ae76a59868f60c1b2b7397ceafa3434beb4b8d954",
      "text": "Tangannya gemetar ketika membuka surat itu.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 43,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "68356fa7bbcbad1a02a162eab42aa53a5e06fd3ef9a203f836787d55a9d5e417",
      "text": "tersadar",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 8,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "689d3ba3a3616222205af80092278ff8e1b30df680b8f6b0e456cbf096e630f7",
      "text": "kekecewaan",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 10,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "6b588b7391da78d962c68227d939dfe08c1dd77e8377ccc841a3dd803118d9d4",
      "text": "Langit kelam membuatnya merinding.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 34,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "6c235f9db69df96b5bf7a2ef93549df3c63780012dd5ce3508425dc3d58588c5",
      "text": "Iya. Katanya, pengarang muda jarang nulis makna tersirat sebagus itu.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 69,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "6d5d85a2007099e53f42fcba725e5c58e93fe1af535437adf0c096a8ef9657d6",
      "text": "terdiam",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 7,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "6d5ee9c9050f9c3ccf8160fbd92885ebe83fb9a72dfb9be81c35076300ebdad5",
      "text": "diterbitkan",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 11,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "6e3d314adea90281c75a8b95311a63f1c51f06197a2b78b1893771bd680f547d",
      "text": "Ayahnya begadang di kantor. Ada kekecewaan sama kerjaannya, kan?",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 64,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "6ef984a2745b09f813e8f9d606c5a32af4db8a715e45ece957c29e477ee29333",
      "text": "Dia menoleh, lalu terpaku di depan pintu.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 41,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "7160a0d96c0fd5ce7ac9f1cc327f9384681ee5bcc226efd3cfd82eeca7d76f74",
      "text": "Dengan akhir terbuka, biar pembaca terus mikir.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 47,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "735069ca1496994f0ce5b5ae6e3fabe4c3a1f4cff3fe680669d3218978503c1f",
      "text": "Dalam cerita mini saya, pencerita bergumam tentang masa kecilnya.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 65,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "73a0ef6fa5817f55910d7b727a27e416c0ebf3f700b6ea9576cbfb9df6ab0fc1",
      "text": "Wah. Aku terdiam baca akhirnya.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 31,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "746b9ae1ceb96046c842d8b11a6276b212d94abbec55ca62a6413474d896aeb6",
      "text": "Betul. Aku juga anak rantau. Ibuku di Samosir masih nunggu.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 59,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "75e13a7fb137938609f7d622c08827ec341c38482d6ffa0239c962a2f45d32c9",
      "text": "isyarat",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 7,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "7893a67089673f61e3741f9c34ddb56aeb3447f5db61ac8b87f3215453f51d07",
      "text": "Dalam keheningan, dia menoleh, lalu terpaku.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 44,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "78cd1792376f7eae549974a62ff7d8da4f385cd6d1644576919aa7f06419d048",
      "text": "Dan monolog batin anak itu penuh rindu. Pengarangnya pintar banget.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 67,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "79a8ab2c23c0b97b9515d4ea0c2237f5110719bf29510c248f5a1a8018758803",
      "text": "Konflik cerita ini adalah antara ayah dan anak. Ayahnya ingin anak itu menjadi petani di kampung, tetapi anaknya ingin kuliah di kota. Mereka bertengkar, lalu anaknya pergi.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 173,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "7cc605968478a7be5b8253f7859497b96702b6767f07a9a055afb80ba0b17064",
      "text": "monolog batin",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 13,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "7d1bbdec080486901743a35edf26c9c2a10b67f8ba384e05220247716b6591b1",
      "text": "Mohamed, cerpen baru ini pakai \"aku\". Siapa pencerita sebenarnya?",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 75,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "7df21384e95d00765c578d0b020c030fd8e68c02dea619e984db6be991f7bf49",
      "text": "digambarkan",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 11,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "7fb2fda2ba28c85bead36b5a56284eecd9acb0a55cfd51c3e9f7e0c1359471b1",
      "text": "Kepergian anaknya meninggalkan kerinduan yang panjang, sehingga ibunya sering duduk di depan pintu.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 99,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "8124b6309009ace6565a0b36da15206e1639cfb4373c4f188141245e0552bd11",
      "text": "kilas balik",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 11,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "86a15257e122fe844c36ce8a2ea14adce9e3c6d7985f3a30aee6282d6cae17c1",
      "text": "menyahut",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 8,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "87468c8a30f86e315ab4a94f4ec29ca0d044002d0b179b88f1af26d22d98dca7",
      "text": "menyindir",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 9,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "87b8a5e77597a3da6d8a44766d5943a33c4e463ccf66cffae9edccc114ced1ff",
      "text": "Pelukan anaknya memberi ___ yang sudah lama hilang.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 51,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "89b93084b7afb3b4a7cddd9414bb4e0a3aee9c344b4b10fd509c2ba32f369b4a",
      "text": "Ayo, Mohamed, cobain. Kuenya enak nggak? Ini bikinan nenekku.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 61,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "8a917783446eded9979fb6befaf848471ee802854458a705f0664aae263ffa59",
      "text": "cerita mini",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 11,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "8ad697bae0cde2a81290f59ee1d6fd1b73284358c44be4a8c17573425c50e6b3",
      "text": "akhir terbuka",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 13,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "8fd36f25233344bfad690980b67832e5215d4bedbf95c84ec7e730a43747fa34",
      "text": "Pencerita orang ketiga tidak selalu tahu perasaan tokoh.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 56,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "90a95114f645ebe09ad20ba713185efd50361bed88d761dc2b71b0a3aa1a9c9c",
      "text": "Gaya bahasa cerpen ini sederhana, tetapi sangat kuat. Penulisnya memakai kalimat pendek dan kata sehari-hari. Walaupun begitu, banyak pembaca menangis di akhir cerita.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 167,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "911e9d051444e8d5e011dfe91918df1de0cbf4c613d01affdc98bcb8b0b7c98a",
      "text": "Makasih, Kak. Aku masih ragu sama kalimat terakhirku.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 53,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "9347f2f69d8578e5e55dff3a2b772f5120acae117b6c5dd5829067c1cbbedcc9",
      "text": "menyentuh",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 9,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "94174b437d2e3f6d1fe736634497a1d27deecb0017ae3ba8d05e48df518c7297",
      "text": "menafsirkan",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 11,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "95041c0f962a9acffc37ebeb2f56d6283c35425954b2be1b83b2d6d839f19aab",
      "text": "tema",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 4,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "99fe334a78b9849fd86610f04c6c4be780ecf8e46d910373358934e7f36050c4",
      "text": "Kalau dia berbisik, berarti dia nggak yakin. Dia cuma berharap.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 63,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "9a116e85d478f1ef333191a1e5e5e9778cfe7f086671d5732380e4ae00f8b965",
      "text": "Dua-duanya bisa benar. Akhirnya kan terbuka.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 44,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "9b6636a47fb71bd86f7d9fc470918f586ca1342e063ce817b5420950b18df893",
      "text": "lugu",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 4,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "9bc89341659f57aa3bbeb7ddbefcb6825415ca9a370b98324c76ea3663aa8322",
      "text": "Langit kelam, dan dari jauh terdengar bisikan angin, padahal tidak ada pohon di sekitar rumah itu.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 98,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "9ee5c0886f2bf9ad8da224caa04447dc4ce1938dcb8d4e7ca4f8164053414bcd",
      "text": "Latar cerita itu sebuah kampung kecil di tepi Danau Toba, karena penulisnya lahir di sana.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 90,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "9f9126614b3be09c44854e733cf8da880bd5c6c31e1128a286cae20361a66420",
      "text": "Dengar kalimat ini, Mohamed. \"Dia pasti pulang,\" bisik Pak Lubis.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 75,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "a1b1fe5784dd57b0aab1ce3f8b66df12ed5c373b9c7b05c8cf35571e09268fb1",
      "text": "berkelana",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 9,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "a296859dd02a9e29e884e456f1328054ab674440445ee9d9b105a46649480fe7",
      "text": "merinding",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 9,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "a521098ae4c30f322b6c63d5d372b6bc17bf14dde7ebce1dfa0df4314e403148",
      "text": "pencerita",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 9,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "a524f3fe477191f3931b264c014babbd52f473adb452e77e8c37be35393d3758",
      "text": "kepergian",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 9,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "a964b5cdb79b7fb977d7ab9d139d2b7f5c30ea1fd8c950f79aaed33f78d396ef",
      "text": "Terus kalimat terakhir, \"Pak Lubis menuang teh ke dua cangkir.\"",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 73,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "aa172772c2a9ade175e1a59b31a3dd81cae4bf8c80f6b07fcc3276b97978b3ba",
      "text": "Dia menghela napas, penuh kerinduan.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 36,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "ab971a156487b33a44cb122795e4ffb74c409be7e9dfa00f449631627133a6d2",
      "text": "Betul. Kalau pengarang nulis \"bentak\", maknanya lain banget.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 70,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "ac017730551c43d16c588c25a92e6dd04e483b3f12f16907b88648c98ef1c1d6",
      "text": "Anaknya berdiri lama di pagar, lalu Pak Lubis menuang teh ke dua cangkir.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 73,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "adeea41419413ece230ef9868e81a91cce5fd8f2d5f1a3bf906e84dba67761cd",
      "text": "Bagian favoritku: ayahnya pulang letih, anaknya nyambut dengan riang.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 69,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "ae2f61349db84945c4687276af68562e4b55003955c5c66cfbf84f66ee65ad30",
      "text": "Cerpen ini dimulai dengan kilas balik ke masa kecil Pak Lubis. Waktu itu dia tinggal bersama ayahnya di tepi sungai. Baru di halaman ketiga, cerita kembali ke masa sekarang.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 173,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "b1dc0a6d749605caed2d473287aa3a6bfed4b4a0fd8e947dbdc8848445e47d3b",
      "text": "Aku menafsirkan hujan itu sebagai simbol kesedihan ayah.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 56,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "b35bbe8f58b3985a54f54ece0bf354e8846892b76f6c4f264567fef319134f87",
      "text": "Seratus kata? Kalau gitu kalimat pembukanya harus kuat banget.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 62,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "b56acaad3d7260ad8614304041d5fdafdf78c4dcccd309863e38f8f9d7bbdf9d",
      "text": "Ayahnya begadang setiap malam untuk mencari nafkah.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 51,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "b7131b99cbf9dfbf3c30a55e195e2268bf2647c112dd2b676679191980660c3d",
      "text": "...dan terpaku. Aku ikut merinding!",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 35,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "b7b6edccef91f5b3c189e99fb1eaa6b89cbb7f0bbc3dc3680c25176d05238a7e",
      "text": "Maaf! Maksudku, enak banget. Aku belum paham makna tersiratnya.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 63,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "c22d5b47255d86fb244d84b63185a20c74b50e7b76f1a37df823301c0ff1d475",
      "text": "\"Jangan bangunkan Nenek,\" bisik Bang Togar.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 53,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "c3c8f46b5de870efafd259e6c31f0622b4a4ee6d81000caa3318301dc19ace52",
      "text": "Amanatnya: Medan itu rumah buat semua orang.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 44,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "c757a34ec07c3f512d223968aaf84990415e9f418ac0046428b2b6ccce1c9706",
      "text": "Iya. Cerpen ini selesai dengan kehangatan, bukan jawaban.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 57,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "ca8b6a4f9f73619463af037ccdf7f5a4ef480c7bb6f4d4a8a19ebd55fa50ce69",
      "text": "gaya bahasa",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 11,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "cb59060c66b3d2454d2f458804aa48bd691b6c98c19b4d997e7c2b2d256d2076",
      "text": "Anaknya merantau ke Jakarta sepuluh tahun yang lalu. Dia bekerja di sebuah kantor besar dan jarang pulang. Setiap Lebaran, dia hanya mengirim uang dan pesan pendek.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 164,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "cc4599591a7b1d5094f2d3f16dec55a3760aee004674f1aed7edccd7b2acd63e",
      "text": "kalau dia menjawab terserah, jangan langsung pergi.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 51,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "cd0839c8376e9034ac414c0da75a1ab15ca1443bfd561c4bf8b67207bcb286ee",
      "text": "Anak Pak Lubis. Jadi kita cuma tahu pikirannya, bukan pikiran ayahnya.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 70,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "cd268eba8a96a6a88f8231d733bce5766f6c89fcdc573b7a855a3700c4e20aad",
      "text": "Kursi itu sudah sepuluh tahun menunggu. \"Dia akan pulang,\" bisik Pak Lubis.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 85,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "cd3cecb51ebc9ce7e7c638018937d3286b20c59232a84757c6ddbb622e91f5a6",
      "text": "Menurutmu, kenapa anaknya berdiri lama di pagar?",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 48,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "cec031367fc0cd957dc7e8a9d2902745fa5ecbc5a2c88d93a8bbfb0557a5d6f9",
      "text": "letih",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 5,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "d1bb7f6d05e95bc83333b5eb1e1a972419b0ca59fd8da712a3865c6607cb638b",
      "text": "kekosongan",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 10,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "d1c472619728e80e697dcf999c9c5e131395f6511fa9d92ceaa4a7294f2aafad",
      "text": "kehangatan",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 10,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "d29278d1c7ba5b896f6cc9b2047af63ab2f69d761517b6cbbf70873b013cb5d2",
      "text": "Jadi kata kerja di luar tanda petik juga bercerita, ya.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 55,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "d61ff97533f4a3fee9810c5142c6f84c801e43f3d5ef40af9ffa697cebcaacc5",
      "text": "Rumah ini milik Tjong A Fie, pedagang Hakka yang kaya.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 54,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "d709ca3a900fc845c2d616538e414e20b2f842c04db6e50e7c5329615060f581",
      "text": "Pak Lubis bergumam sendiri di teras, tetapi tidak ada yang mendengar. Istrinya sedang memasak di dapur. Dia hanya melihat jalan yang kosong sambil memegang cangkirnya.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 167,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "d7bf37ecdb0c702b7b34a1c003353f1d72050c5ea275fd382ec1f72b32188267",
      "text": "hampa",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 5,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "d8256a2fe3344245881f43da1450f0f607ece6857e365f7d18a1d4302246e9e4",
      "text": "kumpulan cerpen",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 15,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "d955e63721d7d56aa27863d88c853678861e8ea5ab6df5633417c180932f15b3",
      "text": "Dia tidak menyahut ketika ibunya memanggil. Dia hanya berbisik kepada adiknya.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 78,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "daec10fbe7b3a7700508bdd8fcf19a154ba9475760c6555f9475d716dc309022",
      "text": "Terus anaknya yang lugu nanya, 'Ayah capek?' Dan ayahnya tersadar.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 76,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "daf342c99000f678515bfe82ef9b82cdda465af7421d051cb20983f74e4e56cf",
      "text": "Kalau gitu, telepon ibumu malam ini, Bang.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 42,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "dc51c8e0fe1b16b062c9d5e2761be786321cf269ae7fdf867ba72e954db656f0",
      "text": "Setiap hari Minggu, satu cerpen diterbitkan di koran itu. Banyak pengarang muda mengirim cerpennya ke sana. Hanya satu cerpen yang dipilih setiap minggu.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 153,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "df6e66691399de0f79b22c8871a7e897a3ae245e0bfeacc2ae2a796e6ddc4aaa",
      "text": "Cerpen ini dibuka sama langit kelam dan keheningan. Serem!",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 58,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "e0ecad25d63908fb500c38d40bbeb5c4075d96da9d6bf13373bdfed7e0e2daa5",
      "text": "Setelah bekerja enam belas jam, dia letih sekali. Dia duduk di kursi tanpa melepas sepatunya. Anaknya ingin bercerita, tetapi dia sudah tertidur.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 145,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "e122d0784fb4ca0ee142336213bf5cdefc9beb3190cd40fd5564d588a9284cbf",
      "text": "Dia berdiri di pagar. Ayahnya menuang teh ke dua cangkir.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 57,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "e6c927519966e19fadf792c129513de76858d692e7322fa7509c6c6be837e23f",
      "text": "Syukurlah. Aku mau jujur, tapi nggak nyakitin penulisnya.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 57,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "e79cfdfee9368e73944444fcfec68027e7fc62e32461bab0baca5dd37830cff0",
      "text": "Ayahnya pulang letih; dia menghela napas, lalu terdiam.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 55,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "e7e83a2e0e4edacfa3578d23ea38e9a44460d162e7efcc86064f995b9ece32a1",
      "text": "Cerpen itu diterbitkan di koran Minggu, lalu masuk kumpulan cerpen terbaik.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 75,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "e8a6a28721a8d6e26653079bf0da5b7f6cec4d15a22bfe32102be6494966ad13",
      "text": "Cerpen ini dimulai dengan kilas balik ke masa kecil Pak Lubis.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 62,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "ebbef1ec59d75e87ac6913f32fa50b12837a803ac4e70e5dd0ccd42d2f9b0c66",
      "text": "Anaknya berdiri lama di pagar. Lalu Pak Lubis menuang teh ke dua cangkir.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 73,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "f337334aa71c21233f206da39d020f3794ee7ab5adcc16b9b327dcc357269896",
      "text": "simbol",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 6,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "f491f88beaf6656177efe7e2f8ddfe316c87a696fce5d9e4a5531914c184aadb",
      "text": "kalimat pembuka",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 15,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "f54066c129851422ce50c77b44408767fb12d2da51122e849f29869878cda862",
      "text": "Ulasan Anda tentang cerpen itu sangat mengesankan, karena Anda menjelaskan gaya bahasanya dengan jelas.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 103,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "f68b781c0156db78d6f3b7bbbc933fda2844fabefb7020478ceb0546fd131407",
      "text": "Pengarang muda itu mengirim cerpennya ke koran Minggu, tetapi sampai sekarang belum ada jawaban.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 96,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "f6c13d8d92d75bac24ec8b4cacdcb4b2fd03af20dcbc8359a635396bcf18e2d2",
      "text": "merantau",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 8,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "fd765fdd024045025efe7ccc244c7df4323d99e8f5f4859e05e58e0f4681e30e",
      "text": "Betul. Dia juga bantu bangun masjid dan kelenteng. Kayak cerpen, rumah ini punya makna tersirat.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 96,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "fd9205d89b0e1693c203a41bf2b1b8ef50950daa81400c2fae3c29c1ed9c0bfd",
      "text": "riang",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 5,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "fdac26cab3f8b807fccc46cf3aea84d2b30f8de304a0c6ba38a881e5173c6eb3",
      "text": "Anaknya berkelana sepuluh tahun. Kerinduannya kerasa di setiap kalimat.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 71,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "fe3b4e3443e7a42fdffe7c5ad0f66c7c6ad16282f7657c6650ee8397ac171269",
      "text": "Dia tersadar bahwa anaknya sudah besar.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 39,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    }
  ],
  "totals": {
    "lessons": 13,
